  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-177/1_REGION_BRUXELLES-CAPITALE\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 177/1_REGION_BRUXELLES-CAPITALE</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2012-06-22/02\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"16\">\n      <p>Les titres services</p>\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n        <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n          <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2015-07-09/17\" data-law-type=\"ORD\" data-article-number=\"45\">\n            >\") ...\n          </span>\".\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n        <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n          <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2015-07-09/17\" data-law-type=\"ORD\" data-article-number=\"45\">\n            >\") ...\n          </span>\".\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 3.</h3>\n        <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n          <p>Est puni d'une sanction de niveau 2, l'employeur, son préposé ou son mandataire qui, en contravention à la loi du 20 juillet 2001 visant à favoriser le développement de services et d'emplois de proximité :</p>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">n'établit pas le contrat de travail titres-services par écrit au plus tard dans les deux jours ouvrables à compter du moment de l'entrée en service du travailleur;</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">établit le contrat de travail titres-services de manière incomplète ou inexacte;</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">\n                <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2015-07-09/17\" data-law-type=\"ORD\" data-article-number=\"45\">\n                  >\") ...\n                </span>\";\n              </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">\n                <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2015-07-09/17\" data-law-type=\"ORD\" data-article-number=\"45\">\n                  >\") ...\n                </span>\";\n              </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">\n                <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2015-07-09/17\" data-law-type=\"ORD\" data-article-number=\"45\">\n                  >\") ...\n                </span>\".\n              </span>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <p>En ce qui concerne les infractions visées à l'alinéa 1er, 1°, 2° et 3°, l'amende est multipliée par le nombre de travailleurs concernés.</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 4.</h3>\n        <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n          <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2015-07-09/17\" data-law-type=\"ORD\" data-article-number=\"45\">\n            >\") ...\n          </span>\".\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"paragraph\">\n        <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 5.</h3>\n        <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n          <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"2\" data-dossier-number=\"2015-07-09/17\" data-law-type=\"ORD\" data-article-number=\"45\">\n            >\") ...\n          </span>\".\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</article>",
